[32m49[m[36m:[m1. Download a portable copy of Python (a full distribution that includes `python.exe`, `pip` and `[1;31mvenv[m`).
[32m50[m[36m:[m    - The official Windows embeddable ZIP is minimal and may lack `[1;31mvenv[m`/`pip`. For best results use a full portable distribution
